WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.810
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:01.080 --> 01:03.160
Are you crazy? Why are you doing this?

3
01:03.160 --> 01:05.000
I'm trying to save our marriage.

4
01:05.000 --> 01:07.106
I'm really disappointed in you.

5
01:09.400 --> 01:10.440
Yo!

6
01:10.440 --> 01:13.480
You expect me to stay and be a throuple with you two?

7
01:13.480 --> 01:16.120
I swear, I had no idea what I was doing just now.

8
01:16.120 --> 01:18.040
Tell them exactly what I told you.

9
01:18.040 --> 01:19.880
I saw ghosts following you.

10
01:19.880 --> 01:20.953
You lying bitch!

11
01:23.800 --> 01:27.480
When the mind is clear, and if we share a karmic connection,

12
01:27.480 --> 01:29.623
we may be able to see the spirit world.

13
01:43.200 --> 01:44.686
What is this?

14
02:07.320 --> 02:08.853
Pan is here, sir.

15
02:12.720 --> 02:16.720
Pan, go get Yohd and Sali. Bring them to me now.

16
02:23.400 --> 02:25.160
Didn't you hear me?

17
02:25.160 --> 02:28.440
Bring Yohd and Sali to me now!

18
02:30.000 --> 02:31.200
Yes, sir.

19
02:47.720 --> 02:50.146
I can't do it. I can't.

20
02:50.713 --> 02:52.333
Why does it have to be me?

21
03:41.360 --> 03:42.800
What's wrong, Pan?

22
03:45.000 --> 03:48.633
Master Lert ordered me to bring Yohd and Sali to serve him.

23
03:49.200 --> 03:51.200
I'll speak to Master Lert myself.

24
03:51.200 --> 03:53.166
Thank you, Uncle.

25
04:04.200 --> 04:05.760
Master Lert, please.

26
04:06.560 --> 04:08.560
Have mercy on Pan.

27
04:09.400 --> 04:11.720
Sali is pregnant.

28
04:11.720 --> 04:13.546
You dare defy my order?

29
04:14.440 --> 04:16.120
No, sir.

30
04:16.120 --> 04:19.120
I'd even give my life for you, Master Lert.

31
04:19.120 --> 04:21.560
I only ask for your mercy.

32
04:22.680 --> 04:26.693
Then death is the only mercy I'll give you.

33
04:53.000 --> 04:55.240
[Old House V1 - May 3] [Western-style, Amarit, Phak Hai]

34
04:55.240 --> 04:57.800
[A monument to scandal] [from the reign of King Rama V]

35
05:01.000 --> 05:05.440
[The Thanahirankit family hid behind] ["Master Lert", a powerful tycoon.]

36
05:05.440 --> 05:08.440
[He had deeply perverse sexual desires.]

37
05:10.040 --> 05:13.040
[To improve her life, Sroi began] [catering to his bizarre desires.]

38
05:13.040 --> 05:15.796
[Lert ordered both male slaves and...]

39
05:21.639 --> 05:23.876
That house you asked me to look into...

40
05:23.876 --> 05:25.280
There's nothing suspicious, Pete.

41
05:25.280 --> 05:29.120
It's just an old family home. Locals clean it now and then.

42
05:29.120 --> 05:31.160
No one's lived there for over 10 years.

43
05:32.840 --> 05:34.560
But when I went inside,

44
05:34.560 --> 05:37.200
I felt like I wasn't alone.

45
05:37.200 --> 05:39.960
Like that double-murder affair last year?

46
05:39.960 --> 05:42.200
A ghost led you to the evidence.

47
05:46.560 --> 05:48.533
- Bag this as evidence. - Yes, sir.

48
06:22.840 --> 06:26.400
But the house we're investigating is over a hundred years old, Jom.

49
06:28.626 --> 06:32.000
I have a feeling something's waiting inside.

50
06:32.000 --> 06:33.560
Maybe it doesn't want our help.

51
06:35.520 --> 06:37.166
Maybe it wants to tell us something.

52
07:10.160 --> 07:13.080
The first riser is off by two centimeters.

53
07:13.080 --> 07:15.000
It doesn't match the drawings.

54
07:16.160 --> 07:17.720
It's only two centimeters.

55
07:17.720 --> 07:20.193
I'll add a topping to level the floor,

56
07:20.193 --> 07:23.723
raise it, and finish it off.

57
07:24.600 --> 07:27.800
Raising the entire floor just to fix one stair

58
07:27.800 --> 07:30.480
adds unnecessary dead load and cost to the project.

59
07:31.280 --> 07:32.560
That's just cutting corners.

60
07:34.080 --> 07:37.120
But it's only two centimeters.

61
07:37.120 --> 07:38.760
Hardly anyone will notice.

62
07:38.760 --> 07:41.440
They may not see it, but they'll feel it when they walk.

63
07:42.400 --> 07:44.420
It may not cost you anything,

64
07:44.420 --> 07:47.600
but the developer has to pay for that extra topping.

65
07:47.600 --> 07:49.316
That's not right.

66
07:51.200 --> 07:54.240
Chip it out and redo the leveling.

67
07:54.240 --> 07:56.240
Follow the exact level I specified,

68
07:56.240 --> 08:00.010
so it won't affect the architectural work and will meet construction standards.

69
08:01.120 --> 08:03.400
Yes, Nat. I'll have the team fix it right away.

70
08:04.616 --> 08:06.283
Make sure it's done right.

71
08:11.942 --> 08:14.183
I'm glad we'll be working together on the new project.

72
08:16.240 --> 08:18.403
Thank you. Goodbye.

73
08:26.480 --> 08:27.990
Nat, watch out!

74
08:32.880 --> 08:34.480
I'm sorry, Nat.

75
08:38.223 --> 08:39.240
I'm so sorry, Nat.

76
08:39.240 --> 08:41.160
What are you guys doing?

77
08:41.160 --> 08:44.876
Good thing I was wearing a hard hat, or my head would've been split open.

78
08:45.623 --> 08:49.080
Don't let this happen again, or you're fired.

79
08:49.080 --> 08:50.400
Yes, Nat.

80
09:00.120 --> 09:04.200
Nat, this can't be a coincidence.

81
09:04.200 --> 09:06.040
Strange things keep happening to you.

82
09:07.040 --> 09:08.439
I think...

83
09:09.040 --> 09:10.840
you should see a fortune teller with me.

84
09:10.840 --> 09:14.463
It's human error, not bad luck.

85
09:14.463 --> 09:18.120
I believe in site management, not superstition.

86
09:18.120 --> 09:19.596
Listen, Nat.

87
09:19.596 --> 09:21.640
Since this project started,

88
09:21.640 --> 09:24.315
there've been accidents and rework.

89
09:24.315 --> 09:26.501
The machinery keeps breaking down.

90
09:26.501 --> 09:28.293
And just now, you almost...

91
09:32.015 --> 09:34.120
Please, Nat.

92
09:34.120 --> 09:36.200
Just go see my fortune teller.

93
09:38.680 --> 09:39.840
Do it for me.

94
09:40.475 --> 09:42.621
Just to put my mind at ease.

95
09:48.400 --> 09:50.520
Clear your mind,

96
09:50.520 --> 09:52.288
then draw three cards each.

97
10:04.280 --> 10:09.936
The cards you've drawn reveal what's within you and what's to come.

98
10:14.600 --> 10:16.280
The Wheel of Fortune.

99
10:17.280 --> 10:20.813
The wheel of fate is in a bad position.

100
10:21.640 --> 10:25.880
It means the cycle will turn, bringing back your karma.

101
10:31.800 --> 10:34.520
Harming and abusing others.

102
10:37.000 --> 10:38.140
Whip her!

103
10:45.240 --> 10:48.080
A severe consequence that could bring everything to an end.

104
11:03.000 --> 11:05.040
Total defeat.

105
11:12.040 --> 11:13.623
The Devil.

106
11:14.320 --> 11:15.840
The abuse of power.

107
11:15.840 --> 11:18.640
I ordered you to bring Sali to me now!

108
11:18.640 --> 11:19.986
Lust and desire.

109
11:20.760 --> 11:25.000
Imprisoning or controlling others through obsession.

110
11:32.560 --> 11:34.560
Karma that will strike without warning.

111
11:36.120 --> 11:38.000
I want each of you to draw one more card.

112
11:51.959 --> 11:53.226
It's all right.

113
11:54.200 --> 11:56.206
That card belongs to both of you.

114
12:04.840 --> 12:06.247
Justice.

115
12:06.920 --> 12:10.360
You reap what you sow.

116
12:10.360 --> 12:11.970
This is ridiculous.

117
12:11.970 --> 12:14.480
A few cards can't decide someone's fate.

118
12:15.400 --> 12:19.080
I believe in what I've built myself, not these pieces of paper.

119
12:19.080 --> 12:21.000
Look back and reflect.

120
12:22.520 --> 12:24.360
You too.

121
12:24.360 --> 12:27.800
Make things right before your luck turns.

122
12:28.760 --> 12:30.800
Once your luck turns,

123
12:30.800 --> 12:32.653
nothing can stop what's coming.

124
12:33.593 --> 12:35.903
Those you've wronged will come to collect their debt.

125
12:42.680 --> 12:45.480
I've been waiting for the day I make you all pay.

126
12:45.480 --> 12:46.646
Bastard Lert!

127
12:48.320 --> 12:49.400
Bitch Bulan!

128
12:55.400 --> 12:58.923
Nat, do you think what I did was wrong?

129
13:00.440 --> 13:01.800
About Yo?

130
13:05.120 --> 13:06.630
If you're wrong, so am I.

131
13:09.440 --> 13:11.480
Do you think Yo will get back at us?

132
13:14.680 --> 13:18.400
From what I know of Yo, she's not the vengeful type.

133
13:22.320 --> 13:26.120
Then who do you think would hold a grudge against us?

134
13:30.720 --> 13:31.880
I don't know.

135
14:16.800 --> 14:18.166
How did a crow get in here?

136
14:22.440 --> 14:25.280
Those you've wronged will come to collect their debt.

137
14:25.280 --> 14:28.480
The day you see a crow,

138
14:29.400 --> 14:31.813
is the day karma begins to work.

139
14:54.600 --> 14:55.653
Nat.

140
15:00.960 --> 15:02.000
Nat!

141
16:14.040 --> 16:17.400
Pam, what's wrong?

142
16:17.400 --> 16:18.693
Nat,

143
16:18.693 --> 16:20.320
I had a nightmare.

144
16:20.320 --> 16:21.920
It was terrifying.

145
16:40.960 --> 16:42.240
Yo,

146
16:43.120 --> 16:44.880
I had a really bad dream last night.

147
16:47.640 --> 16:50.400
It was pitch-dark.

148
16:50.400 --> 16:53.053
I saw you crying in an old house.

149
16:53.800 --> 16:57.640
Then I saw three shadows surrounding you.

150
16:57.640 --> 17:00.000
They seemed really angry with you.

151
17:00.000 --> 17:02.720
Thanks for worrying about me, Pim.

152
17:02.720 --> 17:06.200
That dream really worries me.

153
17:06.200 --> 17:08.240
Go make some merit, okay?

154
17:08.840 --> 17:11.193
I just did.

155
17:11.193 --> 17:12.980
Good.

156
17:12.980 --> 17:14.167
And...

157
17:15.040 --> 17:16.840
how are things with your husband?

158
17:18.520 --> 17:21.606
Nat's been working really hard lately.

159
17:23.000 --> 17:25.640
And what about those women?

160
17:36.100 --> 17:38.699
If you put aside the women I told you about,

161
17:42.440 --> 17:45.960
Nat's actually a good man, Pim.

162
17:45.960 --> 17:49.687
What kind of good man keeps cheating on you?

163
17:49.687 --> 17:52.255
If he's seeing other women, how is he a good man?

164
17:55.680 --> 17:57.309
You've got a point.

165
18:02.440 --> 18:04.560
But I'm out of work right now,

166
18:05.240 --> 18:07.400
and Nat supports me in every way.

167
18:07.400 --> 18:10.883
So you're just going to put up with this?

168
18:11.480 --> 18:13.280
Nothing to say again?

169
18:13.280 --> 18:16.720
If it were me, I'd have left after the first one.

170
18:16.720 --> 18:19.340
But you've put up with two of them.

171
18:19.340 --> 18:22.000
I just want you to face reality.

172
18:22.000 --> 18:26.240
Goodness bought with money isn't really goodness.

173
18:50.520 --> 18:52.120
Who's that?

174
18:52.120 --> 18:53.360
My boss.

175
18:53.360 --> 18:55.327
Stay away from another woman's husband, Whan.

176
19:12.720 --> 19:14.760
Don't change your password yet, Pete.

177
19:24.240 --> 19:26.206
Ayutthaya.

178
19:31.760 --> 19:33.386
Am I bothering you?

179
19:39.680 --> 19:41.666
You seem a little off.

180
19:41.666 --> 19:44.246
I haven't slept well for days.

181
19:44.246 --> 19:46.830
I'm exhausted.

182
19:49.680 --> 19:50.933
Okay.

183
19:51.680 --> 19:54.640
Then I'll get going so you can get some rest.

184
20:08.040 --> 20:10.280
I had some work nearby,

185
20:10.280 --> 20:12.680
so I stopped by to talk about the house.

186
20:12.680 --> 20:14.333
I had a friend look into it.

187
20:14.333 --> 20:16.726
There's really nothing unusual there.

188
20:18.000 --> 20:19.233
There is.

189
20:20.000 --> 20:21.946
I had a feeling there was something too.

190
20:23.280 --> 20:25.520
So I checked some old-house pages.

191
20:26.680 --> 20:28.160
Someone wrote about it,

192
20:29.840 --> 20:31.240
but there was nothing useful.

193
20:31.960 --> 20:34.840
You have to help us. You have to help us.

194
20:34.840 --> 20:37.459
Hey... Hey!

195
20:37.459 --> 20:40.040
You have to help us! You have to help us!

196
20:40.040 --> 20:41.640
You have to help us!

197
20:41.640 --> 20:43.560
Do you hear me? You have to help us!

198
20:43.560 --> 20:44.613
Hey!

199
20:45.440 --> 20:49.040
You must help us! You must help us!

200
20:49.040 --> 20:51.000
Hey!

201
20:55.360 --> 20:57.543
Hey! Are you okay?

202
21:01.640 --> 21:02.756
Hey!

203
21:04.040 --> 21:06.240
I'm afraid Yo might file for divorce.

204
21:06.240 --> 21:08.553
Do you have anything we can use to blackmail her?

205
21:13.560 --> 21:16.899
The first riser was off by two centimeters.

206
21:16.899 --> 21:20.200
It didn't match the drawings, so I had the crew chip it out.

207
21:20.200 --> 21:22.560
They've redone the leveling.

208
21:32.720 --> 21:34.080
What's up, Whan?

209
21:34.080 --> 21:36.800
I found something we can use against Yo.

210
21:37.840 --> 21:38.960
Send it to me.

211
22:04.640 --> 22:05.680
Hey!

212
22:08.840 --> 22:09.920
Hey!

213
22:15.200 --> 22:16.600
Hey...

214
22:32.080 --> 22:33.506
What happened to me?

215
22:35.520 --> 22:37.620
You grabbed my arm really hard

216
22:39.467 --> 22:40.840
and kept saying,

217
22:40.840 --> 22:43.760
"You have to help us. You have to help us."

218
22:43.760 --> 22:45.280
Then you passed out.

219
22:50.279 --> 22:52.693
Maybe it's trying to tell us something.

220
22:57.360 --> 22:58.920
Yeah...

221
22:58.920 --> 23:01.000
A few nights ago, I was meditating

222
23:02.393 --> 23:04.286
and saw people here.

223
23:05.760 --> 23:07.440
They were slaves.

224
23:09.400 --> 23:11.560
It looked so real.

225
23:12.280 --> 23:14.736
Like I'd been pulled into their past.

226
23:15.480 --> 23:17.440
Then the altar caught fire.

227
23:21.920 --> 23:24.120
That's when I came out of the vision.

228
23:32.253 --> 23:34.993
You may think I'm crazy,

229
23:34.993 --> 23:36.253
but I'm telling you the truth.

230
23:37.280 --> 23:40.760
Besides the slaves, did you see anyone else?

231
23:43.600 --> 23:45.640
I saw all three of them.

232
23:46.920 --> 23:47.966
Nat,

233
23:48.773 --> 23:49.853
Pam,

234
23:50.920 --> 23:52.000
Whan.

235
24:25.246 --> 24:28.247
Don't be a fool. Don't go soft on them.

236
24:35.240 --> 24:37.600
They're evil.

237
24:37.600 --> 24:39.893
You need to know the whole truth.

238
24:55.372 --> 24:58.173
We'll show you what really happened.

239
25:13.720 --> 25:18.240
Yohd, I got more Pikul and Sai Yud flowers.

240
25:18.240 --> 25:21.146
Sai Yud smells so lovely.

241
25:22.680 --> 25:26.600
I know... but even Sai Yud can't compete

242
25:26.600 --> 25:28.960
with the love you two have.

243
25:30.207 --> 25:33.773
Sali's already pregnant.

244
25:33.773 --> 25:37.003
But Pan still acts like they're newlyweds.

245
25:38.753 --> 25:40.686
She's my wife.

246
25:40.686 --> 25:42.253
Of course, I really love her.

247
25:48.720 --> 25:49.960
Sali!

248
25:50.840 --> 25:52.000
Sali!

249
25:58.407 --> 26:02.606
That's why I need to earn enough to buy our freedom.

250
26:03.320 --> 26:06.120
Our parents would be so happy, Yohd.

251
26:08.200 --> 26:10.219
Once the baby's born,

252
26:11.480 --> 26:13.946
we'll finally all be together.

253
26:18.400 --> 26:20.366
I don't think it'll be that easy.

254
26:23.433 --> 26:25.210
Master Lert wants to see you.

255
26:41.880 --> 26:45.160
Hurry up and wash Master Lert and Bulan's feet.

256
26:46.000 --> 26:48.480
- Yes. - Always have to be told.

257
27:25.240 --> 27:27.080
Sali!

258
27:27.080 --> 27:30.896
How dare you behave so disgracefully in front of Master Lert!

259
27:34.080 --> 27:36.240
Forgive her, Bulan.

260
27:36.240 --> 27:39.000
Sali's having terrible morning sickness.

261
27:42.320 --> 27:45.440
No wonder you've filled out so nicely.

262
27:47.000 --> 27:49.200
You certainly did the job, Pan.

263
27:52.360 --> 27:54.400
Do your parents know the good news yet?

264
27:55.200 --> 27:56.240
Not yet, sir.

265
27:58.679 --> 28:00.416
Do you want them to?

266
28:03.400 --> 28:04.663
Yes, sir.

267
28:06.760 --> 28:08.680
Then come to my room tonight.

268
28:15.840 --> 28:19.287
Master Lert, please. Let me serve you instead.

269
28:19.287 --> 28:20.980
Sali isn't well.

270
28:25.039 --> 28:26.803
You said it yourself, Pan.

271
28:30.480 --> 28:31.520
Yes, sir.

272
28:35.760 --> 28:38.116
Then come to my room tonight.

273
28:53.240 --> 28:54.740
Bulan.

274
28:59.080 --> 29:02.450
What does Master Lert want Pan to do for him?

275
29:03.280 --> 29:05.000
How dare you ask me?

276
29:06.400 --> 29:08.720
Sali has terrible morning sickness.

277
29:09.880 --> 29:14.943
Please let Pan stay and take care of his wife.

278
29:17.399 --> 29:19.843
So you'll serve Master Lert instead?

279
29:23.000 --> 29:24.040
Yes, my lady.

280
29:26.960 --> 29:28.566
You said it yourself, Yohd.

281
29:42.600 --> 29:45.590
Hurry up, Pan. I'm tired of waiting.

282
29:47.760 --> 29:50.303
Master Lert, I can't do this.

283
29:51.520 --> 29:54.400
And the only woman I love is Sali.

284
29:54.400 --> 29:55.570
Love?

285
29:56.792 --> 29:58.120
You're a slave.

286
29:58.920 --> 30:00.846
You have no right to love.

287
30:03.000 --> 30:04.440
Hurry, Pan.

288
30:04.440 --> 30:06.440
Do as Master Lert says.

289
30:06.440 --> 30:10.556
You know how terrifying Master Lert is when he's angry.

290
30:11.667 --> 30:15.014
Or do you want your wife Sali to suffer because of you?

291
30:17.400 --> 30:19.653
If you won't do it with Yohd while I watch,

292
30:19.653 --> 30:21.680
I'll have Sali dragged here,

293
30:21.680 --> 30:23.800
then I'll do it with her in front of you.

294
30:38.919 --> 30:41.626
Yohd, I'm sorry.

295
31:07.880 --> 31:10.919
Here. A tonic.

296
31:10.919 --> 31:12.320
Drink it.

297
31:17.440 --> 31:18.930
It'll get you in the mood.

298
33:21.200 --> 33:22.240
Yo!

299
33:25.739 --> 33:27.086
Yo!

300
33:27.086 --> 33:28.086
Yo!

301
33:28.680 --> 33:30.159
Yo!

302
33:30.159 --> 33:31.159
Yo!

303
33:34.040 --> 33:35.640
Yo!

304
33:37.286 --> 33:38.286
Yo!

305
33:38.973 --> 33:40.573
Yo!

306
33:41.280 --> 33:42.320
Yo!

307
33:57.360 --> 33:58.800
What's up, Nat?

308
33:58.800 --> 34:01.400
Yo passed out. I don't know what happened.

309
34:01.400 --> 34:04.040
I'm not sure if it's because she fell down the stairs.

310
34:04.040 --> 34:07.910
I checked her insurance. It expired last week.

311
34:08.540 --> 34:11.080
I want to take her to the best hospital possible.

312
34:11.080 --> 34:12.400
Can you help me?

313
34:15.320 --> 34:16.920
Of course.

314
34:16.920 --> 34:18.843
I'll call an ambulance right away.

315
34:19.560 --> 34:21.009
Thank you so much.

316
34:23.280 --> 34:26.273
Yo... Yo...

317
34:49.720 --> 34:51.120
Yo,

318
34:51.120 --> 34:52.238
Yo,

319
34:53.320 --> 34:54.520
how are you feeling?

320
34:56.880 --> 34:59.680
Yo, what happened?

321
34:59.680 --> 35:01.899
Why were you lying on the landing?

322
35:08.280 --> 35:09.926
I'm glad you're okay.

323
35:26.360 --> 35:28.760
Why did you bring me here?

324
35:30.760 --> 35:32.360
I was worried about you.

325
35:34.480 --> 35:36.506
So I asked Pam for help.

326
35:48.720 --> 35:50.031
Yo...

327
35:51.080 --> 35:52.400
What are you doing?

328
35:54.680 --> 35:58.706
Yo, don't. Please don't get angry.

329
35:58.706 --> 36:01.376
I'm not angry at you or her.

330
36:01.376 --> 36:04.440
I'm angry at myself. I have no job, no money,

331
36:04.440 --> 36:06.936
no dignity. I have nothing.

332
36:08.800 --> 36:10.000
I'm going home.

333
36:10.000 --> 36:11.200
Yo. Listen to me.

334
36:11.200 --> 36:12.320
Ouch, Nat!

335
36:12.320 --> 36:13.920
Yo, come on.

336
36:13.920 --> 36:16.500
We're fighting about the same thing all over again.

337
36:17.980 --> 36:20.007
I really didn't want to bring this up,

338
36:20.760 --> 36:22.720
but you've been picking fights so much,

339
36:22.720 --> 36:25.240
I'm starting to think you're cheating.

340
36:25.240 --> 36:26.553
What?

341
36:32.359 --> 36:33.553
Here.

342
36:36.520 --> 36:39.380
There's nothing going on between Pete and me.

343
36:39.380 --> 36:42.000
Then why were you holding onto each other in my house?

344
36:44.280 --> 36:46.294
How did you even meet him?

345
36:46.294 --> 36:47.880
He's been helping me with my work.

346
36:47.880 --> 36:49.283
What work?

347
36:49.283 --> 36:51.587
Then why were you holding each other like that?

348
36:55.680 --> 36:57.759
I don't know, Nat.

349
36:57.759 --> 37:00.113
I just didn't feel like myself.

350
37:00.113 --> 37:02.189
What about me and Whan?

351
37:02.189 --> 37:04.640
We said we were possessed.

352
37:04.640 --> 37:07.080
You didn't believe us. But now you say you weren't yourself?

353
37:07.080 --> 37:08.996
I really don't know.

354
37:09.880 --> 37:11.319
Okay.

355
37:11.319 --> 37:15.420
Then you have to believe Whan and I didn't know either.

356
37:28.400 --> 37:29.960
I didn't do it.

357
37:29.960 --> 37:32.080
I didn't possess them.

358
37:33.080 --> 37:37.837
That bastard Lert is evil! I didn't possess them.

359
37:37.837 --> 37:39.200
I didn't do it!

360
37:39.200 --> 37:42.600
That bastard Lert is evil!

361
37:42.600 --> 37:46.480
I didn't possess them!

362
37:46.480 --> 37:50.480
I didn't possess them!

363
37:50.480 --> 37:53.583
I didn't possess them!

364
38:41.280 --> 38:43.020
I came to see how you're doing.

365
38:43.840 --> 38:46.160
Get well soon, Yo.

366
38:46.160 --> 38:48.333
I'm genuinely worried about you, Yo.

367
38:57.760 --> 38:59.760
Why are you two here?

368
38:59.760 --> 39:01.400
To take care of you.

369
39:02.493 --> 39:06.833
Nat was really upset when you passed out in front of him.

370
39:07.880 --> 39:11.886
But he's also wondering if you're really sick,

371
39:12.953 --> 39:15.871
or just trying to get attention because of that man.

372
39:17.400 --> 39:19.468
There's nothing between Pete and me.

373
39:19.468 --> 39:22.531
And I don't need your help either.

374
39:22.531 --> 39:24.119
Don't be so quick to refuse.

375
39:24.119 --> 39:27.247
Your insurance expired. You're jobless.

376
39:27.880 --> 39:30.480
If I hadn't taken care of everything,

377
39:30.480 --> 39:34.520
you'd be in a charity ward at some public hospital by now.

378
39:38.560 --> 39:41.440
I'll pay back every baht.

379
39:41.440 --> 39:42.880
Don't bother.

380
39:42.880 --> 39:46.560
Consider it payment for taking care of Nat all these years.

381
39:48.480 --> 39:52.200
Now you're free to be with Pete,

382
39:52.200 --> 39:54.695
and let Nat be happy for once.

383
39:55.800 --> 39:57.035
That's right.

384
39:58.280 --> 40:01.000
Pete and I are completely over.

385
40:01.000 --> 40:05.320
If you want to take over, I don't mind at all.

386
40:06.320 --> 40:09.095
Then we'd be even.

387
40:10.520 --> 40:12.918
I still have my morals.

388
40:12.918 --> 40:14.600
I've never cheated on my husband.

389
40:14.600 --> 40:16.500
Morals don't put food on the table.

390
40:17.215 --> 40:22.933
In the real world, only those with power get to decide

391
40:22.933 --> 40:25.860
what's right and what's wrong.

392
40:27.800 --> 40:30.421
Settle things with Nat soon.

393
40:30.421 --> 40:34.447
Before my good intentions turn into something else.

394
40:57.313 --> 40:58.653
How are you?

395
41:01.320 --> 41:02.720
Better.

396
41:04.000 --> 41:05.342
Pete,

397
41:06.039 --> 41:08.720
someone secretly took a photo of us and sent it to Nat.

398
41:08.720 --> 41:10.560
Do you know who took it?

399
41:11.726 --> 41:13.027
Whan, of course.

400
41:15.040 --> 41:16.462
I'm worried about you.

401
41:21.359 --> 41:24.513
The last time I saw you, you weren't yourself.

402
41:28.080 --> 41:32.294
And you told me you saw people in a vision.

403
41:34.560 --> 41:36.167
Are you still seeing them?

404
41:36.800 --> 41:38.241
Yes.

405
41:38.241 --> 41:41.560
Now I'm certain there are spirits in the house.

406
41:42.160 --> 41:45.080
Then we've got a lot of investigating to do.

407
41:45.080 --> 41:47.117
I want to know the truth too.

408
41:49.560 --> 41:52.315
Those spirits really hate Nat.

409
41:55.640 --> 41:57.347
I just want him to be safe.

410
42:05.640 --> 42:07.151
Why do you keep taking pictures?

411
42:13.040 --> 42:15.760
Today's a special day for us,

412
42:15.760 --> 42:18.634
so I wanted a photo to remember it by.

413
42:28.040 --> 42:30.990
I tried to open up to Yo today.

414
42:30.990 --> 42:33.000
But I don't know what she'll think.

415
42:34.362 --> 42:36.006
Let her think whatever she wants.

416
42:36.006 --> 42:37.713
I don't care anymore.

417
42:37.713 --> 42:39.608
I'm tired of it.

418
42:39.608 --> 42:41.349
With Yo, there's always some drama.

419
42:42.000 --> 42:43.904
It's better if she has someone else.

420
42:43.904 --> 42:45.366
Aren't you jealous?

421
42:45.366 --> 42:47.520
I know you still love her.

422
42:47.520 --> 42:51.024
If Yo were sweet and easygoing, I wouldn't do anything to her.

423
42:51.593 --> 42:56.106
But if I can't control her, I'll use that guy as leverage.

424
43:23.600 --> 43:24.800
What's up, Yo?

425
43:25.680 --> 43:28.391
Meet me at home. We need to talk.

426
43:39.040 --> 43:40.846
There's nothing between Pete and me.

427
43:40.846 --> 43:42.840
Whan took that photo on purpose.

428
43:42.840 --> 43:44.320
You've said that many times.

429
43:44.320 --> 43:45.640
I'm just making it clear.

430
43:45.640 --> 43:48.560
Then I'll say this again too. Whan and I were possessed.

431
43:51.200 --> 43:53.888
I don't know what happened between us.

432
43:55.074 --> 43:56.450
But I saw it.

433
43:57.746 --> 43:59.146
Saw what?

434
44:01.320 --> 44:02.760
The three of you in the past.

435
44:07.720 --> 44:09.850
You hurt people, and they want revenge.

436
44:10.440 --> 44:14.307
If you, Pam, and Whan are bound by karma from the past,

437
44:15.360 --> 44:16.800
I forgive you.

438
44:16.800 --> 44:19.040
- No! I won't forgive them! - I'll have my revenge!

439
44:19.040 --> 44:21.040
You'll all die in agony!

440
44:31.120 --> 44:34.482
- Yo! - You must die!

441
44:38.520 --> 44:40.360
Nat has to become a monk.

442
44:40.360 --> 44:42.382
Over some crazy dream you had?

443
44:43.000 --> 44:45.640
I saw what they did to them.

444
44:45.640 --> 44:49.280
They can't forgive their souls being trapped, unable to be reborn.

445
44:49.280 --> 44:50.520
Is there any way to fix this?

446
44:50.520 --> 44:55.304
The three from the past, Lert, Bulan, and Sroi must die.

447
44:56.000 --> 44:58.740
Look what they did to you.

448
45:03.240 --> 45:04.480
Yo!

449
45:05.320 --> 45:06.520
I'm not Yo.

450
45:06.520 --> 45:08.512
I'll get every last one of you.
